The Extract Method refactoring technique involves breaking down a large method into smaller, more manageable methods. Each new method should have a single responsibility and should be named clearly to reflect its purpose.

### Step 3: Apply the Refactoring
We will extract the logic for calculating the layout size into smaller methods. Specifically, we will create methods to handle different ranges of elements and a method to handle the general case.

